# Public repo — no private source

CQB is a generic Go quality-gate kit. It will be published on GitHub.

Never add files, snippets, paths, credentials, or domain language taken
from a private employer or client repository. No `.env`, no compose with
real passwords, no copied services, no ticket IDs, no customer names.

Examples in this repo must be generic Go (a fake `internal/billing` or
similar invented for the kit). If a change only makes sense inside one
company's product, it does not belong here.
